@host = http://localhost:5026

### 1. Get access token (OAuth2 ROPC)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Get current user info (requires token from step 1)
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer <paste_access_token_here>

###
